; Step the frame animation of an entity, then continue at IX
;
; Used by the entities with an animation (#R$BA54, #R$BC26 and others) after their hit test. Pops the animation words
; of the slot: C = countdown and B = reload value, E = frame number and D = number of frames. The countdown goes down
; by one; at zero it reloads from B, the frame number goes up by one and wraps to 0 at D. Both words are pushed back
; (SP is as before) and the routine jumps to IX, which the caller has loaded with its continuation.
; .
; Hardware: none.
;
; IX Address to continue at
; SP Slot address of the animation words
; O:E Frame number after the step
@label=StepAnimation
c$A883 POP BC      ; C = countdown, B = reload
 $A884 POP DE      ; E = frame, D = number of frames
 $A885 DEC C       ;
 $A886 JR NZ,$A890 ; countdown not over
 $A888 LD C,B      ; reload
 $A889 INC E       ; next frame
 $A88A LD A,E      ;
 $A88B CP D        ; wrap at D
 $A88C JR C,$A890  ;
 $A88E SUB D       ;
 $A88F LD E,A      ;
*$A890 PUSH DE     ; put the words back
 $A891 PUSH BC     ;
 $A892 JP (IX)     ; continue at IX
